{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12202460","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12202460","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1220246001:1":{"text":"参った！参った……","source_cn":"不打了不打了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5FCCEE786D0063A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220246002:1":{"text":"降参だ！オレたちが悪かった！この水道管は返すから許してくれ。","source_cn":"打不过，我们认栽，这些管子归你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1D3276E81023769","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220246003:1":{"text":"返してもらうだけで済むわけないでしょう？","source_cn":"我们要水管干嘛？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x418079B654A3BC99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220246004:1":{"text":"じゃあ何しろと？","source_cn":"不抢水管，你们打我们干嘛？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D92DBD2007DEA48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220246005:1":{"text":"もう二度とこんなことしないと反省してください！ラスティーアンカーの給水と浄水システムは、こういう目立たない水道管のおかげで成り立っているのですよ！","source_cn":"不许再破坏这些水管了！整个锈锚港的运水和净水系统，就靠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB6BA321360F100C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status"